{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"جمل أطول ومفردات أقلّ شيوعًا. الكلمات الجديدة في معظمها مشروحة أدناه."},{"btype":"example","text":"I can help Tom out.","note":"يمكن أن أخرج توم من المأزق."},{"btype":"example","text":"Layla can help you.","note":"بإمكان ليلى أن تساعدك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Can you help Yanni?","note":"هل تستطيع مساعدة ياني؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"I have to help Mary.","note":"علي مساعدة ماري."},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni didn't get help.","note":"لم يتلقى ياني المساعدة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Why don't you help me?","note":"لم لا تساعدنني؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"How would you help her?","note":"كيف ستساعدها؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"He didn't want to help.","note":"لم يكن راغبا في المساعدة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Yanni didn't help Skura.","note":"لم يساعد ياني سكورا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Tom and I are here to help.","note":"أنا وتوم هنا لمساعدتك."},{"btype":"example","text":"We really want to help Tom.","note":"نريد حقا ان نساعد توم."},{"btype":"example","text":"Who told you I would help you?","note":"من قال لك أني سأساعدك؟"}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":6,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"en","lang_name":"الإنجليزية","sentences":[{"t":"I can help Tom out.","ar":"يمكن أن أخرج توم من المأزق."},{"t":"Layla can help you.","ar":"بإمكان ليلى أن تساعدك."},{"t":"Can you help Yanni?","ar":"هل تستطيع مساعدة ياني؟"},{"t":"I have to help Mary.","ar":"علي مساعدة ما